WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.000 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Learn two useful shortcuts

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.819 line:92% position:50% size:90%
for your desktop keyboard.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.522 line:92% position:50% size:90%
First, click outside any text input.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.108 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Press question mark to open Keyboard Shortcuts.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.335 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Start with A for Aria,

00:00:20.335 --> 00:00:22.859 line:92% position:50% size:90%
and P for Portfolio.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.195 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Close help with Escape, then press A.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:33.783 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Pause, then press P to open Portfolio.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.032 line:92% position:50% size:90%
On a phone, use

00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:38.634 line:92% position:50% size:90%
the visible tabs instead.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.183 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Practise these two shortcuts

00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:43.935 line:92% position:50% size:90%
at your own pace.
